# 🎓 Student Record Application using AngularJS & Flask

## 📌 Aim

To design and develop a **Student Record Application** using **AngularJS for frontend** and **Flask for backend**, which retrieves and displays student data dynamically.

---

## 🧠 Objective

* To understand AngularJS concepts (ng-app, ng-controller, ng-repeat)
* To integrate frontend with Flask backend
* To fetch and display JSON data from API
* To implement dynamic data binding

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python
* Flask
* AngularJS
* HTML
* REST API (for student data)
* Requests Library

---

